# Sajid Ali — Personal Portfolio

A modern and responsive personal portfolio website showcasing my skills, projects, education, certifications, and experience as a Computer Science & Engineering student.

## 🌐 About

I am a Computer Science & Engineering student at **VIT Bhopal University**, graduating in 2029.

I am interested in:

* Software Engineering
* Python & Java
* Machine Learning
* Natural Language Processing
* Data Engineering
* Problem Solving

This portfolio presents my academic journey and projects while highlighting my goal of becoming a Software Engineer.

## ✨ Features

* Responsive portfolio design
* About Me section
* Skills and technologies
* Project showcase
* Education timeline
