## 📂 Projects

### 1. Phishing Email Detector

A machine-learning project for detecting phishing emails using **Naive Bayes and TF-IDF**.

### 2. BMI Calculator & Health Tips

A simple application that calculates BMI and provides related health information.

### 3. Weather App

A weather application using live API integration to display weather information.

### 4. Quiz App

An MCQ-based quiz application featuring a progress bar, automatic score calculation, percentage calculation, and restart functionality.

### 5. Digital Literacy Project

A project covering cybersecurity awareness, cloud collaboration tools, and professional software skills.

